---
interface Props { data: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="iibb-experience">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap crumb"><b>Impuestos</b> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Ingresos Brutos</div><div class="wrap hero-grid">
<div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Impuesto provincial 2026</span><h1>Facturar no es<br>lo mismo que<br>ganar.</h1><p>Estimá cuánto pagás de Ingresos Brutos según tu provincia, actividad y régimen. Restá retenciones y entendé el saldo antes del vencimiento.</p><div class="chips"><span>🧭 24 jurisdicciones</span><span>✓ Facturación sin IVA</span><span>🏦 Incluye SIRCREB</span></div><div class="map-art"><div class="map"></div><div class="tax-slip"><small>SALDO DEL MES</small><strong>$78.750</strong><span>2,63% efectivo</span></div><span class="province-tag">Cada provincia tiene su alícuota</span></div></div>
<form class="calc"><div class="calc-title"><div><h2>Calculá Ingresos Brutos</h2><p>Empezamos por una sola jurisdicción.</p></div><span class="tag">Parámetros 2026</span></div><div class="section-label">¿Cuál es tu situación?</div><div class="cases"><button type="button" class="case active" data-case="local"><i>📍</i>Una provincia</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="multi"><i>🗺️</i>Convenio Multilateral</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="simple"><i>🧾</i>Régimen simplificado</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="ret"><i>🏦</i>Retenciones y SIRCREB</button></div><div class="section-label">Tus datos</div><div class="fields"><div class="field wide"><label>Facturación gravada del mes · sin IVA</label><div class="inline"><b>$</b><input id="billing" inputmode="numeric" value="3.000.000"></div></div><div class="field"><label>Jurisdicción principal</label><select id="province"><option value="3.5">Buenos Aires</option><option value="3" selected>CABA</option><option value="4">Córdoba</option><option value="4.5">Santa Fe</option><option value="3.5">Mendoza</option><option value="4">Tucumán</option><option value="3.5">Resto del país</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Actividad</label><select id="activity"><option value="1">Comercio</option><option value="1">Servicios generales</option><option value=".65">Profesional / honorarios</option><option value=".5">Industria</option><option value="1.2">Construcción</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Retenciones y percepciones</label><div class="inline"><b>$</b><input id="withholdings" inputmode="numeric" value="11.250"></div></div><div class="field"><label>Ingresos no gravados o exentos</label><div class="inline"><b>$</b><input id="exempt" inputmode="numeric" value="0"></div></div></div><div class="advanced"><span>✓ La base nunca incluye IVA</span><button type="button" id="advanced-toggle">+ Convenio Multilateral</button></div><div class="extra" id="extra-fields"><div class="field"><label>% atribuible a segunda jurisdicción</label><div class="inline"><input id="share2" type="number" min="0" max="100" value="35"><b>%</b></div></div><div class="field"><label>Alícuota segunda jurisdicción</label><div class="inline"><input id="rate2" type="number" min="0" step=".1" value="3.5"><b>%</b></div></div></div><section class="result"><div class="result-top"><div><small id="result-label">Saldo estimado en CABA</small><div class="amount" id="result-amount">$78.750</div></div><div class="rate-card"><small>Alícuota aplicada</small><strong id="result-rate">3,00%</strong></div></div><div class="stats"><span>Impuesto determinado<b id="gross-tax">$90.000</b></span><span>Retenciones a favor<b id="credit-tax">−$11.250</b></span><span>Tasa efectiva<b id="effective-rate">2,63%</b></span></div><button class="go" id="update" type="button">Actualizar estimación</button></section></form>
</div></section>
<section class="journey"><div class="wrap"><header class="center"><span>De la venta al vencimiento</span><h2>Entendé cómo se forma el saldo</h2><p>Ingresos Brutos se calcula sobre lo facturado. Las retenciones y percepciones son pagos adelantados que se descuentan al final.</p></header><div class="journey-grid"><article class="card"><h3>Tu liquidación estimada</h3><div class="tax-row"><span>Facturación gravada</span><b id="detail-base">$3.000.000</b></div><div class="tax-row"><span>Alícuota de actividad</span><b id="detail-rate">3,00%</b></div><div class="tax-row"><span>Impuesto determinado</span><b id="detail-gross">$90.000</b></div><div class="tax-row"><span>Retenciones y percepciones</span><b id="detail-credit">−$11.250</b></div><div class="tax-row total"><strong>Saldo a pagar</strong><b id="detail-total">$78.750</b></div></article><article class="card formula"><h3>La fórmula, sin vueltas</h3><div class="formula-step"><i>1</i><div><b>Partimos de la facturación sin IVA</b><span>Restamos ingresos exentos o no gravados.</span></div></div><div class="formula-step"><i>2</i><div><b>Aplicamos provincia y actividad</b><span>La combinación define la alícuota estimada.</span></div></div><div class="formula-step"><i>3</i><div><b>Descontamos pagos a cuenta</b><span>SIRCREB, retenciones y percepciones reducen el saldo.</span></div></div><div class="warning">⚠️ La alícuota exacta depende del código de actividad, escala y beneficios fiscales. Es una estimación para entender el orden de magnitud.</div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="compare"><div class="wrap"><div class="compare-head"><div><span>Mapa de alícuotas</span><h2>La misma actividad, distinto impuesto</h2></div><p>Ejemplo orientativo para servicios generales</p></div><div class="province-grid"><article class="province"><i>🌊</i><h3>Buenos Aires</h3><p>Régimen local general para prestación de servicios.</p><strong>3,50%</strong><span>ARBA</span></article><article class="province active"><i>🏙️</i><h3>CABA</h3><p>Jurisdicción seleccionada en tu simulación.</p><strong>3,00%</strong><span>Tu caso actual</span></article><article class="province"><i>⛰️</i><h3>Córdoba</h3><p>Alícuota general orientativa para el ejemplo.</p><strong>4,00%</strong><span>Rentas Córdoba</span></article><article class="province"><i>🌾</i><h3>Santa Fe</h3><p>El código fiscal y la actividad pueden cambiarla.</p><strong>4,50%</strong><span>API Santa Fe</span></article></div></div></section>
<section class="multilateral"><div class="wrap multi-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Cuando cruzás provincias</span><h2>Convenio Multilateral reparte la base.</h2><p>Si tenés actividad real en más de una jurisdicción, la facturación no se duplica: se distribuye usando coeficientes construidos con ingresos y gastos.</p></div><div class="flow"><div><small>FACTURACIÓN TOTAL</small><b>$3.000.000</b></div><strong>→</strong><div><small>COEFICIENTE</small><b>65% / 35%</b></div><strong>→</strong><div><small>IMPUESTO POR PROVINCIA</small><b>Se liquida separado</b></div></div></div></section>
<section class="retentions"><div class="wrap ret-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#8bd5ad">Pagos a cuenta</span><h2>Lo retenido no debería pagarse dos veces.</h2><p>Los débitos de SIRCREB, las retenciones de clientes y las percepciones de proveedores se computan como crédito en la declaración mensual.</p></div><div class="ret-card"><div><small>SIRCREB</small><b>Cuenta bancaria</b><span>Débitos sobre acreditaciones</span></div><div><small>RETENCIONES</small><b>Tus clientes</b><span>Descuentos al pagarte</span></div><div><small>PERCEPCIONES</small><b>Proveedores</b><span>Adelantos en tus compras</span></div></div></div></section><div class="foot"></div>
  <section class="support wrap">
    <div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div>
    <aside><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}<small>{s.publisher}</small></a>)}</aside>
  </section>
</div>
<script is:inline>

const $=s=>document.querySelector(s),money=n=>new Intl.NumberFormat("es-AR",{style:"currency",currency:"ARS",maximumFractionDigits:0}).format(Math.round(n)),num=v=>Number(String(v).replace(/\./g,"").replace(",", "."))||0;let activeCase="local";
function calc(){const billing=num($("#billing").value),exempt=Math.min(billing,num($("#exempt").value)),base=Math.max(0,billing-exempt),credit=num($("#withholdings").value),provinceRate=num($("#province").value),activityFactor=num($("#activity").value),rate=provinceRate*activityFactor,share=num($("#share2").value)/100,rate2=num($("#rate2").value);let gross=base*rate/100,label=`Saldo estimado en ${$("#province").selectedOptions[0].textContent}`,shownRate=rate;if(activeCase==="multi"){gross=base*(1-share)*rate/100+base*share*rate2/100;shownRate=gross/base*100||0;label="Saldo total · Convenio Multilateral"}if(activeCase==="simple"){gross=Math.max(0,base?28500:0);shownRate=base?gross/base*100:0;label="Cuota simplificada estimada"}const total=Math.max(0,gross-credit),effective=billing?total/billing*100:0;if(activeCase==="ret")label=credit>gross?"Saldo a favor estimado":"Saldo después de retenciones";$("#result-label").textContent=label;$("#result-amount").textContent=money(total);$("#result-rate").textContent=`${shownRate.toFixed(2).replace(".",",")}%`;$("#gross-tax").textContent=money(gross);$("#credit-tax").textContent=`−${money(credit)}`;$("#effective-rate").textContent=`${effective.toFixed(2).replace(".",",")}%`;$("#detail-base").textContent=money(base);$("#detail-rate").textContent=`${shownRate.toFixed(2).replace(".",",")}%`;$("#detail-gross").textContent=money(gross);$("#detail-credit").textContent=`−${money(credit)}`;$("#detail-total").textContent=money(total)}
document.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{document.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(x=>x.classList.remove("active"));b.classList.add("active");activeCase=b.dataset.case;if(activeCase==="multi")$("#extra-fields").classList.add("open");calc()}));document.querySelectorAll("input,select").forEach(i=>i.addEventListener("input",calc));$("#advanced-toggle").addEventListener("click",e=>{$("#extra-fields").classList.toggle("open");e.currentTarget.textContent=$("#extra-fields").classList.contains("open")?"− Ocultar distribución":"+ Convenio Multilateral"});$("#update").addEventListener("click",e=>{calc();e.currentTarget.textContent="✓ Estimación actualizada";setTimeout(()=>e.currentTarget.textContent="Actualizar estimación",1200)});calc();

</script>
<style>
.iibb-experience{width:100%;overflow:hidden;color:#10223c;background:#fff}

*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#10223c;background:#fff}button,input,select{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
.top{height:88px;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe7ef;display:flex;align-items:center;background:#fff}.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:18px;font-weight:850}.logo{width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:7px;background:#173452;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:13px}.links,.tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px}.links a{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#43526a}.tools span{border:1px solid #d9e2eb;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.tools .profile{background:#132844;color:#fff;border-color:#132844}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(128deg,#f7faff 0%,#f7faff 58%,#eef9f2 100%);padding:25px 0 62px;overflow:hidden}.crumb{font-size:12px;color:#718299;margin-bottom:32px}.crumb b{color:#168158}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:52px;align-items:start}.hero-grid>*{min-width:0}.copy{padding-top:6px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#168158;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:#168158}.copy h1{font-size:51px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.052em;margin:18px 0;color:#0e1d36}.copy>p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#53677e;max-width:510px}.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:23px}.chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe5ed;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;color:#4d6279;font-size:10px}
.map-art{height:238px;margin-top:15px;position:relative}.map{position:absolute;left:55px;top:19px;width:213px;height:181px;background:#e6f5ec;border:1px solid #cce5d5;clip-path:polygon(31% 0,61% 10%,72% 28%,65% 45%,83% 60%,63% 72%,55% 100%,37% 82%,18% 73%,20% 48%,0 35%,23% 22%);filter:drop-shadow(0 18px 25px #17385818)}.map:after{content:"AR";position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#168158;font-size:37px;font-weight:900}.tax-slip{position:absolute;right:26px;top:40px;width:190px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7e3eb;border-radius:15px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 20px 42px #17385815;transform:rotate(2deg)}.tax-slip small{font-size:8px;color:#61768b}.tax-slip strong{display:block;font-size:25px;color:#173858;margin:7px 0 10px}.tax-slip span{font-size:9px;color:#16794e;background:#e8f7ef;padding:5px 7px;border-radius:99px}.province-tag{position:absolute;left:6px;bottom:13px;background:#e8f7ef;color:#176f4c;border:1px solid #cce7d7;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}
.calc{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8e4eb;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 29px;box-shadow:0 25px 60px #173b6418;position:relative;z-index:2}.calc-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.calc h2{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 4px}.calc-title p{font-size:10px;color:#60758c;margin:0}.tag{font-size:9px;color:#16794e;background:#e7f7ef;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 10px;font-weight:800;height:max-content;white-space:nowrap}.section-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:850;color:#293b53;margin:17px 0 8px}.cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px}.case{border:1px solid #dce5ec;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 4px;color:#52677f;font-size:8px;font-weight:750;min-height:66px}.case i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:3px}.case.active{border:2px solid #24905e;background:#eff9f3;color:#147247}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.field{border:1px solid #dbe4eb;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;min-height:57px}.field.wide{grid-column:span 2}.field label{display:block;color:#63788e;font-size:8px;margin-bottom:5px}.field input,.field select{border:0;outline:0;background:none;width:100%;color:#142641;font-weight:750;font-size:13px}.inline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}.inline b{font-size:12px}.advanced{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:11px 0;color:#566d84;font-size:9px}.advanced button{border:0;background:none;color:#168158;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;padding:0}.extra{display:none;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px;margin-bottom:10px}.extra.open{display:grid}.result{background:#17324f;color:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:18px 20px}.result-top{display:flex;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.result small{font-size:9px;color:#c5d3df}.amount{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:850;margin-top:4px}.rate-card{background:#e8f7ef;color:#176f4c;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 11px;text-align:right}.rate-card small{color:inherit}.rate-card strong{display:block;font-size:15px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;border-top:1px solid #375675;padding-top:12px;margin-top:13px}.stats span{font-size:8px;color:#b9cad8}.stats b{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}.go{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:#24905e;color:#fff;font-weight:800;padding:12px;margin-top:14px}
.journey{padding:74px 0 68px}.center{text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 36px}.center span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#168158;font-weight:850}.center h2{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0}.center p{color:#5e7288;line-height:1.6}.journey-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;gap:20px}.card{border:1px solid #dce5ec;border-radius:16px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 10px 27px #1738580b;background:#fff}.card h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 19px}.tax-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5ebf0}.tax-row span{font-size:10px;color:#5e7288}.tax-row b{font-size:12px;text-align:right}.tax-row.total{border:0;background:#eaf7ef;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 15px;margin-top:12px;color:#176f4c}.formula{background:#f7fafc}.formula-step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:14px 0}.formula-step i{font-style:normal;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:#e8f7ef;color:#168158;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:850}.formula-step b{display:block;font-size:10px}.formula-step span{display:block;color:#65798f;font-size:9px;margin-top:3px}.warning{background:#fff7e7;border:1px solid #efdaad;border-radius:11px;padding:13px;margin-top:17px;color:#755319;font-size:9px;line-height:1.55}
.compare{background:#f4f8fb;padding:68px 0}.compare-head{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}.compare-head h2{font-size:35px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:9px 0 0}.compare-head span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#168158;font-weight:850}.compare-head p{font-size:9px;color:#60758a}.province-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}.province{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5ec;border-radius:14px;padding:18px}.province.active{border:2px solid #24905e}.province i{font-style:normal;font-size:21px}.province h3{font-size:12px;margin:10px 0 4px}.province p{font-size:8px;color:#687d91;line-height:1.5}.province strong{display:block;font-size:22px;color:#173858;margin-top:13px}.province span{font-size:8px;color:#60758a}.province.active span{color:#168158;font-weight:800}
.multilateral{padding:69px 0}.multi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.78fr 1.22fr;gap:45px;align-items:center}.multi-grid h2{font-size:36px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0 14px}.multi-grid p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#60758a}.flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;border-radius:16px;padding:23px}.flow div{background:#f5f9f7;border-radius:11px;padding:16px;text-align:center}.flow small{display:block;font-size:8px;color:#60758a}.flow b{display:block;font-size:15px;margin-top:6px}.flow>strong{color:#8a9aab}.retentions{background:#17324f;color:#fff;padding:66px 0}.ret-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.76fr 1.24fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}.ret-grid h2{font-size:35px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0 13px}.ret-grid p{color:#c0cfdd;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65}.ret-card{background:#fff;color:#17324f;border-radius:16px;padding:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}.ret-card div{background:#f5f8fb;border-radius:11px;padding:15px;text-align:center}.ret-card small{display:block;color:#60758a;font-size:8px}.ret-card b{display:block;font-size:18px;margin:7px 0}.ret-card span{font-size:8px;color:#5c7186}.foot{height:110px}
@media(max-width:800px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 28px,1160px)}.links{display:none}.hero-grid,.journey-grid,.multi-grid,.ret-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.copy{text-align:center}.copy h1{font-size:39px}.eyebrow,.chips{justify-content:center}.map-art{max-width:390px;margin-inline:auto}.calc{padding:20px 16px}.cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.province-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.tools span:not(:last-child){display:none}}@media(max-width:480px){.copy h1{font-size:36px}.map{left:15px}.tax-slip{right:0}.fields,.extra{grid-template-columns:1fr}.field.wide{grid-column:auto}.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.province-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.flow>strong{transform:rotate(90deg)}.ret-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.support{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:40px;padding:70px 0}.support h2{font-size:24px}.support details{border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed;padding:14px 0}.support summary{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer}.support p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#5f7187}.support a{display:block;border:1px solid #dce5ee;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin:8px 0;color:#1769bd;text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.support small{display:block;color:#65798d;margin-top:4px}
@media(max-width:800px){.support{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
